<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <style>
        body { font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif; margin: 0; padding: 0; background-color: #f4f7f9; }
        .outer-table { width: 100%; background-color: #f4f7f9; }
        
        /* Main Container */
        .container { 
            width: 90%; 
            max-width: 650px; 
            margin: 20px auto; 
            background-color: #ffffff; 
            border: 1px solid #e0e0e0; 
        }

        /* Header Section */
        .header { 
            background-color: #326ce5; 
            color: #ffffff; 
            padding: 25px; 
            text-align: center; 
        }
        .header h2 { margin: 0; font-size: 24px; }
        .header p { margin: 5px 0 0 0; opacity: 0.9; font-size: 16px; }

        /* Content Section */
        .content { padding: 30px; font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif; line-height: 1.6; color: #333333; }
        
        /* Table Styling */
        .metrics-table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin: 20px 0; font-size: 14px; }
        .metrics-table th { 
            background-color: #f8f9fa; 
            color: #555555; 
            text-align: left; 
            padding: 12px; 
            border-bottom: 2px solid #dee2e6; 
        }
        .metrics-table td { 
            padding: 12px; 
            border-bottom: 1px solid #eeeeee; 
        }
        .category-icon { font-weight: bold; color: #326ce5; }
        
        /* Elements */
        .badge { 
            background-color: #eef2ff; 
            color: #326ce5; 
            padding: 4px 8px; 
            font-family: monospace; 
            border: 1px solid #eef2ff;
        }

        /* Footer Section */
        .footer { 
            font-size: 12px; 
            color: #888888; 
            text-align: center; 
            padding: 20px; 
            background-color: #fcfcfc; 
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body style="margin: 0; padding: 0; background-color: #f4f7f9;">
    <table class="outer-table" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="100%" bgcolor="#f4f7f9">
        <tr>
            <td align="center" style="padding: 20px 0;">
                <table class="container" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="100%" bgcolor="#ffffff" style="max-width: 650px;">
                    <tr>
                        <td class="header" bgcolor="#326ce5" align="center" style="padding: 25px;">
                            <h2 style="margin: 0; color: #ffffff;">Cluster Resource Snapshot</h2>
                            <p style="margin: 5px 0 0 0; color: #ffffff; opacity: 0.9;">Automated Session & Workload Report</p>
                        </td>
                    </tr>
                    
                    <tr>
                        <td class="content" style="padding: 30px;">
                            <p>Hello,</p>
                            <p>The scheduled scan of the cluster is complete. Here is the high-level resource allocation across active categories:</p>
                            
                            <table class="metrics-table" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="100%">
                                <thead>
                                    <tr>
                                        <th style="background-color: #f8f9fa; padding: 12px; border-bottom: 2px solid #dee2e6;">Category</th>
                                        <th style="background-color: #f8f9fa; padding: 12px; border-bottom: 2px solid #dee2e6;">Count</th>
                                        <th style="background-color: #f8f9fa; padding: 12px; border-bottom: 2px solid #dee2e6;">Total vCPU</th>
                                        <th style="background-color: #f8f9fa; padding: 12px; border-bottom: 2px solid #dee2e6;">Total RAM</th>
                                    </tr>
                                </thead>
                                <tbody>
                                    <tr>
                                        <td style="padding: 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid #eeeeee;"><span class="category-icon" style="color: #326ce5; font-weight: bold;">Sessions</span></td>
                                        <td style="padding: 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid #eeeeee;">{{ sessions.count }}</td>
                                        <td style="padding: 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid #eeeeee;">{{ sessions.total_cpu }} vCPU</td>
                                        <td style="padding: 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid #eeeeee;">{{ sessions.total_ram }} GiB</td>
                                    </tr>
                                    <tr>
                                        <td style="padding: 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid #eeeeee;"><span class="category-icon" style="color: #326ce5; font-weight: bold;">Applications</span></td>
                                        <td style="padding: 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid #eeeeee;">{{ apps.count }}</td>
                                        <td style="padding: 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid #eeeeee;">{{ apps.total_cpu }} vCPU</td>
                                        <td style="padding: 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid #eeeeee;">{{ apps.total_ram }} GiB</td>
                                    </tr>
                                    <tr>
                                        <td style="padding: 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid #eeeeee;"><span class="category-icon" style="color: #326ce5; font-weight: bold;">Jobs</span></td>
                                        <td style="padding: 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid #eeeeee;">{{ jobs.count }}</td>
                                        <td style="padding: 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid #eeeeee;">{{ jobs.total_cpu }} vCPU</td>
                                        <td style="padding: 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid #eeeeee;">{{ jobs.total_ram }} GiB</td>
                                    </tr>
                                    <tr>
                                        <td style="padding: 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid #eeeeee;"><span class="category-icon" style="color: #326ce5; font-weight: bold;">Orphans</span></td>
                                        <td style="padding: 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid #eeeeee;">{{ orphans.count }}</td>
                                        <td style="padding: 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid #eeeeee;">{{ orphans.total_cpu }} vCPU</td>
                                        <td style="padding: 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid #eeeeee;">{{ orphans.total_ram }} GiB</td>
                                    </tr>
                                </tbody>
                            </table>

                            <p>Detailed per-pod metadata is attached as <span class="badge" style="background-color: #eef2ff; color: #326ce5; padding: 4px 8px; font-family: monospace;">{{ file_name }}</span> for your records.</p>
                        </td>
                    </tr>

                    <tr>
                        <td class="footer" bgcolor="#fcfcfc" align="center" style="padding: 20px; color: #888888; font-size: 12px;">
                            Automated Governance Service • CMLMonitor • {{ datetime }}
                        </td>
                    </tr>
                </table>
                </td>
        </tr>
    </table>
</body>
</html>